<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Crear Cuenta | CodeSnap</title>
    <style>
        /* MISMO CSS QUE LOGIN PARA MANTENER LA ESTÉTICA */
        :root { --main-blue: #007AFF; --bg: #f5f5f7; }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cfd9df 0%, #e2ebf0 100%);
            height: 100vh; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
        }
        .glass-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            border-radius: 35px;
            padding: 50px;
            width: 100%; max-width: 400px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { color: #86868b; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        input {
            width: 100%; padding: 16px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px; transition: 0.3s;
        }
        input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--main-blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0,122,255,0.1); }
        .btn-auth {
            width: 100%; padding: 16px; border: none; border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--main-blue); color: white; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .footer-link { margin-top: 25px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .footer-link a { color: var(--main-blue); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
        .error-msg { background: #ff3b3020; color: #ff3b30; padding: 10px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="glass-box">
        <h1>Registro</h1>
        <p>Crea tu cuenta profesional hoy.</p>

        <% if(error) { %> <div class="error-msg"><%= error %></div> <% } %>

        <form action="/auth/register" method="POST">
            <input type="text" name="nombre" placeholder="Elige un usuario" required>
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Contraseña" required>
            <input type="password" name="confirmPassword" placeholder="Repetir contraseña" required>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-auth">Registrarme</button>
        </form>

        <div class="footer-link">
            ¿Ya eres miembro? <a href="/login">Inicia sesión aquí</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>